(a) When the urban homesteader and the commissioner of housing and community development agree on a suitable dwelling for the homesteader, the homesteader shall enter into either a lease agreement with the city or an urban homesteading agreement in combination with a deed of conditional conveyance. The forms of both types of documents will be prepared by the city attorney’s office. The lease form or combination of urban

