A person licensed under this article shall:

(1) Adhere to inventory. Make no additions whatsoever, during the period of the licensed sale, to the stock of goods set forth in the inventory attached to the application for a license;

(2) Advertise properly. Refrain from employing any untrue, deceptive or misleading advertising;

(3) Adhere to advertising. Conduct the licensed sale in strict conformity with any advertising or holding out incident thereto;

(4) Keep duplicate inventory. Keep available at the place of sale a duplicate copy of the inventory submitted with the application and present the duplicate to inspecting officials upon request; and

