excessive peeling paint or other condition reflective of deterioration or inadequate maintenance.

a. Floors, interior walls, and ceiling of every structure shall be structurally sound and maintained in a clean and sanitary condition, and that such floors be free of broken, missing or otherwise damaged tiles or parts thereof.

